Adapted in: Sources/AudioRoutingEngine/CoreAudioProperties.swift
The AudioObjectID property-reading helpers (generic read / readString /
readArray over AudioObjectGetPropertyData, and the process-object list and
PID-translation accessors) follow AudioCap's ProcessTap/CoreAudioUtils.swift.

